sty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其一","author":"徐熥","text":"二十年来旧管弦，几家车马闹门前。\n谁知万劫青楼恨，尽在西湖一语禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24289,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其二 乐昌公主","author":"徐熥","text":"菱花初剖镜分鸾，十载长持半面看。\n约得幽期正月望，人间天上共团圞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24290,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其三 文君","author":"徐熥","text":"岂为新缘胜旧缘，却因词赋暗相怜。\n世人不解心中事，只说蛾眉爱七弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24291,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其四 盼盼","author":"徐熥","text":"剑履尘埋已十春，教成歌舞不随身。\n泉台得早重相见，深感多情白舍人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24292,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其五 秦弱兰","author":"徐熥","text":"莫笑邮亭一夜春，此身元已落风尘。\n韩家亦有如花女，枕畔衣裳着向人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24293,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其六 聂胜琼","author":"徐熥","text":"解将纨素卸花钿，谁识新欢是旧缘。\n从此相思千点泪，不须和雨到窗前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24294,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其七 楚娘","author":"徐熥","text":"入宫元不爱蛾眉，来是欢娱去是悲。\n不有新词消尽妒，此身依旧路傍枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24295,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其八 曹妙清","author":"徐熥","text":"比玉芳名号雪斋，更无春色入幽怀。\n横琴独坐香闺晚，欲把新诗和铁崖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24296,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画士女 其九 题双文小像","author":"徐熥","text":"鸾笺半幅为传神，画里相逢梦里亲。\n安得人间綵灰酒，莺莺夜夜似真真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24297,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画芍药送张叔麟","author":"徐熥","text":"相送愁吟芍药诗，丹青聊赠插瓶枝。\n披图不尽销魂意，何必垂杨绾别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24298,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]